16A+","MEGA-OLL-16B-","MEGA-OLL-16B+","MEGA-OLL-17A-","MEGA-OLL-17A+","MEGA-OLL-17B-","MEGA-OLL-17B+","MEGA-OLL-18A","MEGA-OLL-18B","MEGA-OLL-18C","MEGA-OLL-18D","MEGA-OLL-18E-","MEGA-OLL-18E+","MEGA-OLL-19A-","MEGA-OLL-19A+","MEGA-OLL-19B-","MEGA-OLL-19B+","MEGA-OLL-19C-","MEGA-OLL-19C+","MEGA-OLL-19D-","MEGA-OLL-19D+","MEGA-OLL-19E-","MEGA-OLL-19E+","MEGA-OLL-19F-","MEGA-OLL-19F+","MEGA-OLL-20A-","MEGA-OLL-20A+","MEGA-OLL-20B-","MEGA-OLL-20B+","MEGA-OLL-20C-","MEGA-OLL-20C+","MEGA-OLL-20D-","MEGA-OLL-20D+","MEGA-OLL-20E-","MEGA-OLL-20E+","MEGA-OLL-20F-","MEGA-OLL-20F+","MEGA-OLL-21A-","MEGA-OLL-21A+","MEGA-OLL-21B-","MEGA-OLL-21B+","MEGA-OLL-21C-","MEGA-OLL-21C+","MEGA-OLL-21D-","MEGA-OLL-21D+","MEGA-OLL-21E-","MEGA-OLL-21E+","MEGA-OLL-22A","MEGA-OLL-22B","MEGA-OLL-23A","MEGA-OLL-23B","MEGA-OLL-24A-","MEGA-OLL-24A+","MEGA-OLL-24B-","MEGA-OLL-24B+","MEGA-OLL-25A-","MEGA-OLL-25A+","MEGA-OLL-25B-","MEGA-OLL-25B+","MEGA-OLL-26A-","MEGA-OLL-26A+","MEGA-OLL-26B-","MEGA-OLL-26B+","MEGA-OLL-27A-","MEGA-OLL-27A+","MEGA-OLL-27B-","MEGA-OLL-27B+","MEGA-OLL-29-","MEGA-OLL-29+","MEGA-OLL-30A-","MEGA-OLL-30A+","MEGA-OLL-30B-","MEGA-OLL-30B+","MEGA-OLL-31A-","MEGA-OLL-31A+","MEGA-OLL-31B-","MEGA-OLL-31B+","MEGA-OLL-32A-","MEGA-OLL-32A+","MEGA-OLL-32B-","MEGA-OLL-32B+","MEGA-OLL-33A-","MEGA-OLL-33A+","MEGA-OLL-33B-","MEGA-OLL-33B+","MEGA-OLL-34A","MEGA-OLL-34B","MEGA-OLL-34C","MEGA-OLL-34D","MEGA-OLL-34E-","MEGA-OLL-34E+","MEGA-OLL-35A-","MEGA-OLL-35B-","MEGA-OLL-35B+","MEGA-OLL-35C-","MEGA-OLL-35C+","MEGA-OLL-35D-","MEGA-OLL-35D+","MEGA-OLL-35E-","MEGA-OLL-35E+","MEGA-OLL-35F-","MEGA-OLL-35F+","MEGA-OLL-36A-","MEGA-OLL-36A+","MEGA-OLL-36B-","MEGA-OLL-36B+","MEGA-OLL-36C-","MEGA-OLL-36C+","MEGA-OLL-36D-","MEGA-OLL-36D+","MEGA-OLL-36E-","MEGA-OLL-36E+","MEGA-OLL-36F-","MEGA-OLL-36F+","MEGA-OLL-37A-","MEGA-OLL-37A+","MEGA-OLL-37B-","MEGA-OLL-37B+","MEGA-OLL-37C-","MEGA-OLL-37C+","MEGA-OLL-37D-","MEGA-OLL-37D+","MEGA-OLL-37E-","MEGA-OLL-37E+","ll-4","Last layer in 4 stages","<p><a href=\"/en/glossary#eo\" class=\"termo-do-glossario\" title=\"Edge orientation: each edge turned so that it can go to its place without using F and B.\">EO</a> (the top star), <a href=\"/en/glossary#co\" class=\"termo-do-glossario\" title=\"Corner orientation: twisting the top corners until the top color is all on the top face.\">CO</a> (the top face one color), <a href=\"/en/glossary#ep\" class=\"termo-do-glossario\" title=\"Edge permutation: putting the top edges, already oriented, in their right places.\">EP</a> and <a href=\"/en/glossary#cp\" class=\"termo-do-glossario\" title=\"Corner permutation: putting the top corners, already oriented, in their right places.\">CP</a> (the pieces in place). Few algorithms per stage.</p>\n",[390,391,392,393],"/megaminx/treino?grupo=eo,co,ep,cp",{"_11":443,"_13":443,"_46":395,"_48":444,"_50":51,"_52":445,"_26":446},{"_11":423,"_13":423,"_46":395,"_48":424,"_50":51,"_52":425,"_26":426},{"_11":414,"_13":414,"_46":395,"_48":415,"_50":51,"_52":416,"_26":417},{"_11":394,"_13":394,"_46":395,"_48":396,"_50":51,"_52":397,"_26":398},"Megaminx CP","iniciante",15,[399,400,401,402,403,404,405,406,407,408,409,410,411,412,413],"/megaminx/cp","MEGA-CP1","MEGA-CP2","MEGA-CP3","MEGA-CP4","MEGA-CP5","MEGA-CP6","MEGA-CP7","MEGA-CP8","MEGA-CP9","MEGA-CP10","MEGA-CP11","MEGA-CP12","MEGA-CP13","MEGA-CP14","MEGA-CP15","Megaminx EP",5,[418,419,420,421,422],"/megaminx/ep","MEGA-EP1","MEGA-EP2","MEGA-EP3","MEGA-EP4","MEGA-EP5","Megaminx CO",16,[427,428,429,430,431,432,433,434,435,436,437,438,439,440,441,442],"/megaminx/co","MEGA-CO1","MEGA-CO2","MEGA-CO3","MEGA-CO4","MEGA-CO5","MEGA-CO6","MEGA-CO7","MEGA-CO8","MEGA-CO9","MEGA-CO10","MEGA-CO11","MEGA-CO12","MEGA-CO13","MEGA-CO14","MEGA-CO15","MEGA-CO16","Megaminx EO",3,[447,448,449],"/megaminx/eo","MEGA-EO1","MEGA-EO2","MEGA-EO3","f2l","Middle layers","<p>The layers around the white face, from the bottom up, in 4 steps with short algorithms, until only the top face is left.</p>\n",[],{"_13":451,"_26":455},"/megaminx/f2l","estrela","Star and 1st face","<p>The &quot;star&quot; (the 5 edges of the white face, like the <a href=\"/en/glossary#cruz\" class=\"termo-do-glossario\" title=\"The 4 edges of one face (usually white) in place, lined up with the centers. The first step of the beginner method and of CFOP.\">cross</a>) and the 5 white corners, with the <a href=\"/en/glossary#sexy-move\" class=\"termo-do-glossario\" title=\"The trigger R U R' U', the most common of all.\">sexy move</a> <code>DR F DR&#39; F&#39;</code>.</p>\n",[],{"_13":457,"_26":461},"/megaminx/estrela","megaminx","/megaminx/",{"_465":466,"_467":468},"cubos",[471,472,473,474,475,476],"idiomas",[469,470],"pt","en",{"_11":482,"_13":482},{"_11":481,"_13":481},{"_11":480,"_13":480},{"_11":479,"_13":479},{"_11":462,"_13":25},{"_11":477,"_13":478},"pyraminx","Pyraminx","5x5","4x4","2x2","3x3"]
